summary: Your scripts, in ~/.config/metafolder/scripts/, and the templates to start one from (default: list)

!! Reference

```
Your scripts, in ~/.config/metafolder/scripts/, and the templates to start one from (default: list)

Usage: mf script [COMMAND]

Commands:
  list  Print the scripts directory, the scripts the GUI offers, and the templates
  new   Copy a template into the scripts directory, to adapt it (asks which one when none is named, on a terminal)
  help  Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help
          Print help
```
